<title>SINGAPORE: Malayan Credit changes name to MCL Land.</title>
<headline>Malayan Credit changes name to MCL Land.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1997-03-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Malayan Credit Ltd said in a statement on Thursday it had officially changed its name to MCL Land Ltd.</p>
<p>-- Singapore newsroom (65 870 3080)</p>
